 r←Test_TableEdit_200(stopFlag batchFlag);parms;n;⎕TRAP;table;rowTitles
⍝ Test quitting the table editor. No changes are made and the user shall not be prompted.
 r←∆Inactive
 :Return

 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 table←⍪'Obama' 'Bush' 'Clinton' 'Reagan' 'Kennedy'
 table,←'Barak' 'George' 'Bill' 'Ronald' 'John'
 table,←?5 10⍴1000000
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Table.CreateParms
 parms.posn←35 25
 parms.size←400 600
 parms.caption←'Test_TableEdit_200: check "Close"'
 parms.confirmQuit←0
 parms.testMode←1

 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Table.Create table #.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults parms
 1 ⎕NQ n.∆Form'Close'
 0.1 ∆Process n.∆Form

 →GoToTidyUp table≢n.∆result

 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
